&lt;p&gt;For this question, we use the table given below-&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-f8c718a0-7fff-a6ac-2629-56e90d16cd63&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;  background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:498px;height:120px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/Uxgr_G802QW7RApeBuePNnZtqmR-nsYw6J4D70LKGhSXc9062q3pr1Ofc63TqAjb35BPzX8ShofL2xTr5qP9xtKW4y0YWjJsgxXO-ulQy6PVi7Kl75LyGWr6AFtN__bh5z5mvy-9&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; width: 450px; height: 107px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The pattern followed is:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Steps:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;i) &lt;strong&gt;+ 3&lt;/strong&gt; is done in the &lt;strong&gt;first letter&lt;/strong&gt; to &lt;strong&gt;obtain the next letter&lt;/strong&gt; of the series.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;N + 3 = Q&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Q + 3 = T&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;T + 3 = W&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;W + 3 = Z&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;​&lt;/strong&gt;ii) &lt;strong&gt;Sum of the digits of the middle number gives the positional value of the last letter.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;First number: 13 = 1 + 3 = 4. Thus last letter positional value will be 4 which is D.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Second number: 16 = 1 + 6 = 7.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Thus last letter positional value will be 7&amp;nbsp;which is G.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Third number: 19 = 1 + 9 = 10.&amp;nbsp;Thus last letter positional value will be 10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;which is J&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Fourth number: 22 = 2 + 2 = 4.&amp;nbsp;Thus last letter positional value will be 4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;which is D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Fifth number: 25 = 2 + 5 = 7.&amp;nbsp;Thus last letter positional value will be 7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;which is G&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F1_Savita_State%20Govt._30-7-22_D1.png&quot; style=&quot;width: 101px; height: 453px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Hence, &lt;strong&gt;Option (2)&lt;/strong&gt; is correct.&lt;/p&gt;

